{{ op.authorize_fn | default(value="") }}
/// Service operation `{{ op.op_name }}` (service `{{ op.service }}`, issue
/// #590): `POST …/{id}/actions/{{ op.snake }}` — the IFML action button's
/// wire shape (#559) with the actor policy enforced server-side. Child
